        - Output: :math:`(N, C, H_{out}, W_{out})` or :math:`(C, H_{out}, W_{out})`, where

          .. math::
              H_{out} = \left\lfloor\frac{H_{in}  + 2 \times \text{padding}[0] -
                \text{kernel\_size}[0]}{\text{stride}[0]} + 1\right\rfloor

